<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m Earl! Professor of the streets!\nPhD in homies from Hood University!\fIt’s online!\rI’ma make you a BETTER Hustler!\rWhat you wanna know?\nYou tryna win? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BET! Lesson one! The homie at the TOP\nof your crew jump out first in a scrap!\rMove your homies around, make scraps\neasier! That’s called STRATEGY!\rYou want more game from Earl? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, you wanna know how to raise\nhomies right? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BET! Listen!\nIf a homie jump in a scrap even for a\fsec, it get Exp. Points!\rLead with the weak homie, then\nswitch it out quick!\rThat’s how weak homies get strong!\fLike internships! Unpaid!\rYou want more game from Earl? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, you wanna know how to\nscrap better? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BET! Listen up!\nHomies got strengths and weaknesses\f’cause of types!\rA high-level homie can still lose\nwith a bad matchup!\rPick homies that CLAP the other\nhomie’s type! That’s a smart scrap!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OHHH! You a SMART student!\nI got nothin’ left to teach!\fI’m unemployed again!\rBe good to your homies, aight?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m takin’ notes on Earl’s lecture.\rHe been talkin’ for six hours.\nI think he forgot we here.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I traded my best homie to the kid\nnext to me for a Fruit Roll-Up.\fBiggest L of my life.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? The homie I just got is holdin’\nsomethin’! ...It’s a parkin’ ticket.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Some Berries can heal a homie up.\rHomies can hold a lotta other stuff...\rTakin’ notes is HARD, bro. My hand\ncrampin’ and I only wrote “Berries.”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Homies got somethin’ called abilities!\rEvery kinda homie got its own thing.\rMy ability is fallin’ asleep\nin class. Super effective.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The board explain status\nproblems in scraps.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Read which topic? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If it’s food poisoned, a homie\nkeep losin’ HP.\rIt don’t stop after the scrap,\nyou lose HP walkin’ too.\fHit it with a Pepto.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gettin’ tased cut speed and might\nstop it from movin’.\rIt stay after the scrap, so\nrub on some Icy Hot.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If your homie passed out, it can\nonly use moves like Dream Talk and\fLoud Snore.\rA passed-out homie don’t wake up\nafter the scrap.\fWake it up with a Red Bull.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A burn eat HP, little by little,\nand cut the Attack stat too.\rIt stay after the scrap.\nSlap some Aloe Vera on it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If your homie iced out,\nit can’t do NOTHIN’.\rIt stay iced after the scrap.\nWarm it up with Hot Cheetos.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s this youngblood’s notebook...\r“Recruit homies with Hood Balls.\nYou can roll with six max.”\rKeep readin’? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Before you throw a Hood Ball,\nrough ’em up first.”\r“A food poisoned or burnt homie\nis easier to recruit.”\rKeep readin’? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Some moves get a homie faded.\nA faded homie might hit\fitself.”\r“Leavin’ the scrap sobers\n’em up.”\rKeep readin’? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“People who recruit homies and\nscrap with ’em are called Hustlers.”\r“They supposed to run up on\nblocks and beat other Hustlers.”\rThe next page is... Blank!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Boy: Heh heh...\nI ain’t write nothin’ else...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TACOS</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0560_T22R0301_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TASED</language>
	</row>
